---
// Root landing / automatic language redirector
import { ORGANIZATION_SCHEMA, getWebsiteSchema } from '../utils/structuredData';

const rootSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    ORGANIZATION_SCHEMA,
    getWebsiteSchema('es')
  ]
};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Códigos de Roblox Actualizados | Roblox Codes</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Portal oficial de códigos de Roblox actualizados hoy. Códigos activos para Blox Fruits, Blade Ball, DTI y más juegos con copia en 1 clic." />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/es/" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://codigosroblox.org/es/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="48x48" href="/favicon-48x48.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/favicon-16x16.png" />
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#080C14" />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(rootSchema)} />
    <script is:inline>
      const preferredLang = (navigator.language || navigator.userLanguage || '').toLowerCase();
      if (preferredLang.startsWith('en')) {
        window.location.replace('/en/');
      } else {
        window.location.replace('/es/');
      }
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#080c14] text-white flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen font-sans p-4">
    <main class="text-center max-w-md w-full space-y-6 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 backdrop-blur shadow-2xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 mx-auto">
        <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">CódigosRoblox.org</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">
          Portal de códigos de Roblox actualizados hoy con copia en 1 clic.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-1">
          Redirigiendo automáticamente / Redirecting automatically...
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 pt-2">
        <a 
          href="/es/" 
          class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/25 hover:shadow-indigo-600/40"
        >
          <span>🇪🇸</span>
          <span>Versión en Español</span>
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/en/" 
          class="flex-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-200 hover:text-white font-semibold text-sm transition-all border border-slate-700"
        >
          <span>🇬🇧</span>
          <span>English Version</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        <p>No estamos afiliados, asociados ni respaldados por Roblox Corporation. Roblox es una marca registrada de Roblox Corporation.</p>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
